            {
              "chatMessage": {
                "text": "Fix for TW-102566: the \"Copy Prompt\" button logged no FUS event.\n\nThe change registers a new `copy.prompt.clicked` event in `BuildsViewCollector`, bumps the `teamcity.builds.view` group version to 3, and logs both click events in `BuildOverviewPanel` next to the buttons. A new test clicks both buttons and asserts the logged events.\n\nNote for the reviewer: `build/events/FUS.properties` needs a description key `teamcity.builds.view.copy.prompt.clicked`. The automation may modify only `plugins/teamcity-intellij`, so the key is not part of this change.\n\nAIR automation run: https://air.jetbrains.cloud/org/05cf1a7f-6ab5-713b-abd3-29d0c8a05e2d/automations/177ac64b-cafa-4747-adbc-4b80c6747011?run=9f7bf925-3831-4695-a36c-6624605a685d\n\nProduced by Air Automations. Name: TeamCity IJ plugin bug fixer / Run: https://air.jetbrains.cloud/org/05cf1a7f-6ab5-713b-abd3-29d0c8a05e2d/automations/177ac64b-cafa-4747-adbc-4b80c6747011?run=9f7bf925-3831-4695-a36c-6624605a685d",
